Here is a small but neat spoiler. Which you probably all know. 






















If you can handle Black puddings- Ie have excalibur and some good blessed or
rust proofed armor then this is a good thing to do. -- 
Kick the crud out of a sink for a long time. You will be able to survive by
eating black puddings. And you will eventually get the ring from the sink, and
you will also fill the level up with succubi. Which you can talk to and go up
levels- It doesn't always happen, but sometimes you gain experience- (we all
know that.) well if you keep on kicking the sink and eating black puddings you
can create levels full of slinky types. So whenever you walk through the level
on the way to somewhere you get raised to full potential and gain experience. I
have a 23 level A who has 150 HP and 30 million experience points on that level
and I havent even go to the medusa yet. He is can wield Stormbringer or
Excalibur or Mjollnir. What a lucky Character no? He blessed all his armor and
so the puddlings bite of no avail. Last I counted there were 16 Succubi on two
different levels all ready and willing. (The puddings also brought me a bag of
holding and several rings.)  
